* There was also a problem with how timezone-aware datetime objects were handled when `tz="utc"` was specified. The code now correctly converts these objects to UTC.
* Added type checks to ensure the function behaves correctly with different types of input.
* Corrected logic for boxing return values when `tz="utc"` and `box=True`.
* Fixed issues with localization and conversion of datetime arrays without timezone information.

